{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"installation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Installation"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"command-not-found","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Command not found"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# Use npx instead\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n\n# Or reinstall globally\nnpm install -g @tanstack/cli","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"permission-denied","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Permission denied"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use a Node version manager:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"curl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.39.0/install.sh | bash\nnvm install 20","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"node-too-old","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Node too old"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Requires Node.js 18+:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"node --version  # Check\nnvm install 20  # Upgrade","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"project-creation","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Project Creation"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"directory-exists","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Directory exists"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create my-app-v2              # Different name\ntanstack create my-app --target-dir ./new/path  # Different path\ntanstack create my-app -f              # Force overwrite","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"add-on-fetch-failed","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add-on fetch failed"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check internet. Or use local:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"git clone https://github.com/TanStack/cli.git\ncd cli && pnpm install && pnpm build\nnode packages/cli/dist/index.js create my-app","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"conflicting-add-ons","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Conflicting add-ons"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Some add-ons conflict with each other (e.g., multiple ORMs, multiple auth providers). Use "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"--addon-details <id>"},{"type":"text","value":" to see what conflicts with what:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create --addon-details clerk","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"runtime","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Runtime"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"missing-env-vars","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Missing env vars"}]},{"type":"code","value":"cp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with your values\npnpm dev  # Restart","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tailwind-not-working","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tailwind not working"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Check "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".tanstack.json"},{"type":"text","value":" has "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"\"tailwind\": true"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"styles.css"},{"type":"text","value":" imports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@import 'tailwindcss'"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"mcp-server-removal","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MCP Server Removal"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"tanstack mcp"},{"type":"text","value":" has been removed from the CLI. Use the CLI introspection commands instead:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create --list-add-ons --json\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk --json\ntanstack libraries --json\ntanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start --json\ntanstack ecosystem --category database --json","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If you need MCP in your generated app, keep using the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"mcp"},{"type":"text","value":" add-on during app creation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"./mcp-migration.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"MCP Migration"}]},{"type":"text","value":" for command-by-command replacements."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"getting-help","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Getting Help"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Include when reporting:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"npx @tanstack/cli --version"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"node --version"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"OS and package manager"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Full error message"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Links:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/cli/issues","children":[{"type":"text","value":"GitHub Issues"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"https://tlinz.com/discord","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Discord"}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":2},{"id":"command-not-found","text":"Command not found","level":3},{"id":"permission-denied","text":"Permission denied","level":3},{"id":"node-too-old","text":"Node too old","level":3},{"id":"project-creation","text":"Project Creation","level":2},{"id":"directory-exists","text":"Directory exists","level":3},{"id":"add-on-fetch-failed","text":"Add-on fetch failed","level":3},{"id":"conflicting-add-ons","text":"Conflicting add-ons","level":3},{"id":"runtime","text":"Runtime","level":2},{"id":"missing-env-vars","text":"Missing env vars","level":3},{"id":"tailwind-not-working","text":"Tailwind not working","level":3},{"id":"mcp-server-removal","text":"MCP Server Removal","level":2},{"id":"getting-help","text":"Getting Help","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## Installation\n\n### Command not found\n\n```bash\n# Use npx instead\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n\n# Or reinstall globally\nnpm install -g @tanstack/cli\n```\n\n### Permission denied\n\nUse a Node version manager:\n\n```bash\ncurl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.39.0/install.sh | bash\nnvm install 20\n```\n\n### Node too old\n\nRequires Node.js 18+:\n\n```bash\nnode --version  # Check\nnvm install 20  # Upgrade\n```\n\n## Project Creation\n\n### Directory exists\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app-v2              # Different name\ntanstack create my-app --target-dir ./new/path  # Different path\ntanstack create my-app -f              # Force overwrite\n```\n\n### Add-on fetch failed\n\nCheck internet. Or use local:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/TanStack/cli.git\ncd cli && pnpm install && pnpm build\nnode packages/cli/dist/index.js create my-app\n```\n\n### Conflicting add-ons\n\nSome add-ons conflict with each other (e.g., multiple ORMs, multiple auth providers). Use `--addon-details <id>` to see what conflicts with what:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk\n```\n\n## Runtime\n\n### Missing env vars\n\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with your values\npnpm dev  # Restart\n```\n\n### Tailwind not working\n\nCheck `.tanstack.json` has `\"tailwind\": true` and `styles.css` imports `@import 'tailwindcss'`.\n\n## MCP Server Removal\n\n`tanstack mcp` has been removed from the CLI. Use the CLI introspection commands instead:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --json\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk --json\ntanstack libraries --json\ntanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start --json\ntanstack ecosystem --category database --json\n```\n\nIf you need MCP in your generated app, keep using the `mcp` add-on during app creation.\n\nSee [MCP Migration](./mcp-migration.md) for command-by-command replacements.\n\n## Getting Help\n\nInclude when reporting:\n- `npx @tanstack/cli --version`\n- `node --version`\n- OS and package manager\n- Full error message\n\nLinks:\n- [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/TanStack/cli/issues)\n- [Discord](https://tlinz.com/discord)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: troubleshooting\ntitle: Troubleshooting\n---\n\n## Installation\n\n### Command not found\n\n```bash\n# Use npx instead\nnpx @tanstack/cli create my-app\n\n# Or reinstall globally\nnpm install -g @tanstack/cli\n```\n\n### Permission denied\n\nUse a Node version manager:\n\n```bash\ncurl -o- https://raw.githubusercontent.com/nvm-sh/nvm/v0.39.0/install.sh | bash\nnvm install 20\n```\n\n### Node too old\n\nRequires Node.js 18+:\n\n```bash\nnode --version  # Check\nnvm install 20  # Upgrade\n```\n\n## Project Creation\n\n### Directory exists\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app-v2              # Different name\ntanstack create my-app --target-dir ./new/path  # Different path\ntanstack create my-app -f              # Force overwrite\n```\n\n### Add-on fetch failed\n\nCheck internet. Or use local:\n\n```bash\ngit clone https://github.com/TanStack/cli.git\ncd cli && pnpm install && pnpm build\nnode packages/cli/dist/index.js create my-app\n```\n\n### Conflicting add-ons\n\nSome add-ons conflict with each other (e.g., multiple ORMs, multiple auth providers). Use `--addon-details <id>` to see what conflicts with what:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk\n```\n\n## Runtime\n\n### Missing env vars\n\n```bash\ncp .env.example .env\n# Edit .env with your values\npnpm dev  # Restart\n```\n\n### Tailwind not working\n\nCheck `.tanstack.json` has `\"tailwind\": true` and `styles.css` imports `@import 'tailwindcss'`.\n\n## MCP Server Removal\n\n`tanstack mcp` has been removed from the CLI. Use the CLI introspection commands instead:\n\n```bash\ntanstack create --list-add-ons --json\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk --json\ntanstack libraries --json\ntanstack search-docs \"server functions\" --library start --json\ntanstack ecosystem --category database --json\n```\n\nIf you need MCP in your generated app, keep using the `mcp` add-on during app creation.\n\nSee [MCP Migration](./mcp-migration.md) for command-by-command replacements.\n\n## Getting Help\n\nInclude when reporting:\n- `npx @tanstack/cli --version`\n- `node --version`\n- OS and package manager\n- Full error message\n\nLinks:\n- [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/TanStack/cli/issues)\n- [Discord](https://tlinz.com/discord)\n"}
